stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> RUNNING: process_video returns request_id
    RUNNING --> RUNNING: status is RUNNING
    RUNNING --> AuthRequired: authentication required
    AuthRequired --> RUNNING: OAuth returns AUTHENTICATED
    RUNNING --> COMPLETED: status is COMPLETED
    RUNNING --> FAILED: FAILED / UNKNOWN / invalid response
    FAILED --> RUNNING: retry status with same request_id
    FAILED --> Idle: start over
    COMPLETED --> Workspace: open durable artifacts
    Workspace --> Idle: process another video

    note right of RUNNING
        Persisted in runs/jobs.json
        Polled every 8 seconds
    end note
    note right of FAILED
        Error text remains visible
        Retry never resubmits the video
    end note
    note right of COMPLETED
        notes.md and frames remain durable
        Qdrant can be rebuilt or reused
    end note
